{"seq":3,"slug":"developer-experience","title":"开发者体验","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/api-design-patterns/developer-experience","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"error-design","title":"错误设计与状态码","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/api-design-patterns/developer-experience/error-design","wordCount":1106,"readingTime":5},{"seq":2,"slug":"docs-sdk-generation","title":"文档生成与 SDK 工程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/api-design-patterns/developer-experience/docs-sdk-generation","wordCount":999,"readingTime":4},{"seq":3,"slug":"ai-agent-apis","title":"AI Agent 可调用的 API 设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/api-design-patterns/developer-experience/ai-agent-apis","wordCount":1004,"readingTime":5}],"introMarkdown":"# 开发者体验\n\nAPI 的终极用户不是机器，而是坐在屏幕前阅读文档、调试请求的开发者——以及 2026 年越来越多的 AI Agent。一个\"能用\"的 API 和一个\"好用\"的 API 之间的差距，往往就在错误信息是否可行动、文档是否可交互、SDK 是否零配置可用。\n\n本章从错误设计、文档与 SDK 生成、AI 可调用性三个维度，系统化地提升 API 的消费者体验。\n"}